## Motion and preference variants

Support:

- `motion-safe:`
- `motion-reduce:`
- `contrast-more:` if feasible
- `print:` if feasible
- Pointer or hover capability variants if implemented

Users must not have to sacrifice accessibility to use expressive animations.

## Variant composition

Support composed variants with documented ordering rules, such as:

```html
<div class="md:hover:shadow-lg"></div>
```

Build a real parser that handles utility candidates with brackets, parentheses, quotes, and nested value syntax without incorrectly splitting every colon.

Do not claim complete Tailwind variant compatibility unless it has been independently implemented and tested.

