## Reduced motion

All essential functionality must remain understandable with reduced motion enabled.

Provide motion-preference variants and sensible animation behavior. Avoid making important content invisible until a keyframe finishes.

Do not animate everything. Motion should provide feedback, establish hierarchy, or help users understand state changes.

