## Phase 4 — Theme and design-token system

Implement semantic tokens, configurable breakpoints, color themes, typography, shadows, spacing, and radii.

**Completion test:** Switching theme configuration changes generated theme values without requiring a redesign of every utility class.

## Phase 5 — Production compiler

Implement optimized output, deterministic ordering, caching where appropriate, improved scanning, safe watch mode, diagnostics, and output-size reporting.

**Completion test:** A representative project compiles repeatably, and watch mode updates correctly without infinite rebuilds.

## Phase 6 — Motion, depth, and advanced utilities

Implement transitions, transformations, tasteful animation presets, group/peer variants where reliable, and advanced layout utilities.

**Completion test:** The showcase projects demonstrate the implemented advanced utilities while respecting reduced-motion preferences.

